aa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟出流江","author":"刘崧","text":"乘流清夜下芒洲，尽敞篷窗看月钩。\n滩面忽惊波转急，青山无数泊船头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25065,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入峡潭","author":"刘崧","text":"水上石山森剑铓，水中石屋是鱼房。\n秋来水落月未出，鱼眼射波如火光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25066,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻刘友文病起二首 其一","author":"刘崧","text":"诗帙不来春又过，药瓢应是日相亲。\n无因为报池南柳，长得新条长过人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25067,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻刘友文病起二首 其二","author":"刘崧","text":"俗李粗桃故近人，也应无处避埃尘。\n春风看尽亭前水，惟有鸥凫不厌频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25068,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨竹","author":"刘崧","text":"羽衣何处采仙茆，海上蓬山紫翠交。\n帝子欲来风露冷，月中遥见绿云梢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25069,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨雀","author":"刘崧","text":"乍逐微风度柳槐，又随斜日噪楼台。\n晴沙如雪江村路，何处飞来啄雨苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25070,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月五日同鹏举萧茂材白水道人游三华未至留宿山下袁氏明日雨作望三华在咫尺不能至乃冒雨步归袁君追至山外不果留途中因赋柬同游者","author":"刘崧","text":"三华山在乱云间，晴日寻春雨却还。\n想见飞桥转楼阁，碧桃花下水潺潺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25071,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过柳溪道院","author":"刘崧","text":"岸上谁家掩素扉，鸟啼浑似惜春晖。\n日斜深巷无人过，时见梨花一片飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25072,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过江南高城访孙景贤知事途中有作因录奉柬","author":"刘崧","text":"屋角桃花深浅开，临溪欲过复徘徊。\n谁知不是寻春者，自为山人看竹来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25073,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过江南高城访孙景贤知事途中有作因录奉柬","author":"刘崧","text":"渡江一望一咨嗟，水绕田园径路斜。\n多谢野人相指引，青松岭外第三家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25074,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过江南高城访孙景贤知事途中有作因录奉柬","author":"刘崧","text":"家在松萝杳霭间，屋西流水并沙湾。\n可怜万里怀乡意，日上高城望北山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25075,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题云松图","author":"刘崧","text":"何事携琴更载书，青山深处是幽居。\n白云日日岩前起，松下茯苓应可锄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25076,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下北岩适举正鹏举自溪上来迎道中赋此","author":"刘崧","text":"步出北岩望平野，石角垂萝青可把。\n多谢萧钟两故人，相迎直过青山下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25077,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五月二十二日晚来南溪诸友过武山避暑","author":"刘崧","text":"晓上西华爱日凉，松风如雪洒衣裳。\n夕阳欲没月初上，乱石满山疑卧羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25078,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨鹰","author":"刘崧","text":"霜毛剑翮耀星瞳，独立高林劲气雄。\n青鸟低飞空侧目，平原一击待秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25079,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]